---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ASSETS } from '../data/assets';

const title = 'Grave Seasons Is Still Coming Soon';
const description =
  'Grave Seasons is still coming soon. Steam App 3255110 lists March 9, 2027. Blumhouse still says Fall 2026. No US price.';
const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Coming soon', url: '/still-coming-soon/' },
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} image={ASSETS.hero.src}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="section-kicker">Checked October 26, 2026</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black leading-tight text-bone md:text-5xl">Still coming soon. Two dates.</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fog">
      Steam App 3255110, checked October 26, 2026, still marks Grave Seasons as coming soon and still
      lists <strong>March 9, 2027</strong>. Blumhouse still lists Fall 2026. Neither date is a walkthrough.
    </p>
    <figure class="mt-8">
      <img src={ASSETS.hero.src} alt={ASSETS.hero.alt} width={ASSETS.hero.width} height={ASSETS.hero.height} class="rounded-md border border-white/10" loading="eager" />
      <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs text-fog">{ASSETS.hero.credit}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-fog">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-bone">What the October 26 check printed</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Coming soon. Release field: March 9, 2027. No US price on the app details.</li>
        <li>Windows only on that Steam row. Mac and Linux are not listed.</li>
        <li>Single-player. Steam Achievements. Full controller support. Family Sharing.</li>
        <li>The minimum OS line is still TBD. That is not a hardware chart.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-bone">What this page will not invent</h2>
      <p>
        A killer route, a crop calendar, and a romance unlock are not on the store page. The one-year
        investigation, 12 romanceable folks, and 30-plus residents stay on the
        <a class="text-wheat underline" href="/pre-launch-investigation-checklist/">checklist</a>.
        The two dates stay on <a class="text-wheat underline" href="/steam-date-versus-fall-window/">Steam versus Fall 2026</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Wishlist if you want the notification. Do not pay a number this page did not print. A leaked
        dollar amount is not the button.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
